------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The acoustic fingerprint used by the "Audio ID" feature is a Kotlin
reimplementation of the format documented by SongRec:

    SongRec — https://github.com/marin-m/SongRec
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

No SongRec code is bundled or linked, and no Shazam or ShazamKit SDK is used.
Captured audio is processed in memory and discarded — never stored, never
transmitted.

The plugin runtime executes plugins written for the Nuclear plugin API
(https://github.com/nukeop/nuclear). Those plugins are downloaded at runtime and
remain separate works under their own licenses; no plugin code is bundled in this
app, and Rizx is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Nuclear project.

